  {"text": "Fast delivery ab customer ki aadat ban chuki hai. Isi aadat pe Indian delivery company Shadowfax ka quarterly profit, ek saal mein paanch guna se zyada ho gaya.", "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-content-machine-videos/aa924ba0-3440-5e30-b033-1b0773fd73bd/scratchpad/r1117/l1.wav"},
  {"text": "July se September mein profit 68 crore rupaye, pichle saal isi samay sirf 13 crore. Har seller ke liye isme teen seekh hain.", "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-content-machine-videos/aa924ba0-3440-5e30-b033-1b0773fd73bd/scratchpad/r1117/l2.wav"},
  {"text": "Pehli, delivery speed ab product ka hissa hai. Doosri, order ka status automatic bhejo, customer ke poochne se pehle. Teesri, pin code ke hisaab se saaf delivery time likho, aur wahi nibhao.", "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-content-machine-videos/aa924ba0-3440-5e30-b033-1b0773fd73bd/scratchpad/r1117/l3.wav"},
  {"text": "Customer sirf product nahi, intezaar bhi kharidta hai. Ye reel save karo, aur aaj apna delivery time check karo.", "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-content-machine-videos/aa924ba0-3440-5e30-b033-1b0773fd73bd/scratchpad/r1117/l4.wav"}
 ],
